+| S28 | `semantic.k:137–138` | Exact built-in `len` call evaluates its argument | Sound for the one used built-in/binding. Other calls remain visibly unmodeled. |
+| S29 | `semantic.k:139` | `len(PyList)` uses `length` | Sound. |
